# Cut on beat - no overlap at all. For genres where a fade is simply wrong.

name    Cut on beat
note    no overlap - a straight swap on the bar line
align   beat
tempo   free
power   constant

lane out gain
    at 0.0    1.0    hold
    at 0.5    0.0    hold
    at 1.0    0.0    hold

lane in gain
    at 0.0    0.0    hold
    at 0.5    1.0    hold
    at 1.0    1.0    hold
